{
    "title": "Block Puzzle",
    "description": "\u201cBlock Puzzle\u201d is an addictive relaxing puzzle game you'll want to play today and every day! \ud83e\udde9It's the perfect choice when you want to unwind and take some time for yourself. \ud83c\udfc6Come to play Block Puzzle Daily and give your brain a rest!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1Highlights:\r\n \u2043 Beautifully easy and simple, no pressure and no time limit.\r\n \u2043 Easy to play,  Classic brick game for all ages!\r\n \u2043 Challenging to break your highest score.\r\n \u2043 Multiple beautiful background pictures.\r\n \u2043 Multiple materials of blocks.  Such as: wood, candy, jewel, gems\u2026\r\n \u2043 Useful tools to help you break the highest score.\r\n \u2043 Perfect brain training game & perfect for killing time\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fHow To Play\uff1f\r\n \u2043 Match and clear as many colored blocks as possible\uff01\r\n \u2043 Fill blocks in a vertical or horizontal line to clear them.\r\n \u2043 No Time Limited! \r\n \u2043 Just clear and fun!\r\n\r\nBlock Puzzle is Suitable for all age and completely FREE to play! Use your wisdom and strategy to clear color blocks, enjoy the Block Puzzle challenges now!\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fWho's the best brick breaker? Come and play this game and become a master of block puzzle game now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u201cBlock Puzzle\u201d is an addictive relaxing puzzle game you&#39;ll want to play today and every day! \ud83e\udde9It&#39;s the perfect choice when you want to unwind and take some time for yourself. \ud83c\udfc6Come to play Block Puzzle Daily and give your brain a rest!<br><br>\ud83d\udca1Highlights:<br> \u2043 Beautifully easy and simple, no pressure and no time limit.<br> \u2043 Easy to play,  Classic brick game for all ages!<br> \u2043 Challenging to break your highest score.<br> \u2043 Multiple beautiful background pictures.<br> \u2043 Multiple materials of blocks.  Such as: wood, candy, jewel, gems\u2026<br> \u2043 Useful tools to help you break the highest score.<br> \u2043 Perfect brain training game &amp; perfect for killing time<br><br>\ud83c\udf1fHow To Play\uff1f<br> \u2043 Match and clear as many colored blocks as possible\uff01<br> \u2043 Fill blocks in a vertical or horizontal line to clear them.<br> \u2043 No Time Limited! <br> \u2043 Just clear and fun!<br><br>Block Puzzle is Suitable for all age and completely FREE to play! Use your wisdom and strategy to clear color blocks, enjoy the Block Puzzle challenges now!<br><br>\u2764\ufe0fWho&#39;s the best brick breaker? Come and play this game and become a master of block puzzle game now!",
